    <string name="steps_explain_title">Count your steps?</string>
    <string name="steps_explain_body">The phone has a built-in step counter. To read it, Android asks for the \"Physical activity\" permission. The app reads it only when you open it, keeps the numbers on this phone, and never sends them anywhere. Steps you take while the app is closed are added to the day you next open it, so the numbers are approximate.</string>
